{"pageid":1939,"title":"Update Log/Version 1.45.0","displaytitle":"2023 Christmas Update","revid":20585,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>2023 Christmas Update</b> (<a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.45.0\" title=\"Version 1.45.0\">v1.45.0</a>) was introduced on December 10th, 2023. It introduced a large amount of new items and new resources (tables below), and the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>. The Snowlands contain <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_tree\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snow tree\">Snow Trees</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Icestone\" title=\"Icestone\">Icestone</a>. \n</p><p>Meteor crashes were changed to Gift Drops (unofficial name) in this update, making <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_Core\" title=\"Meteor Core\">Meteor Cores</a> unobtainable for the duration. Gift Drops happen at the same location as meteor crashes, and spawn Christmas-related items and gifts. The gifts could no longer be purchased after December 24th.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Additions\">Additions</span></h2>\n<p>In the tables below is a list of the new items, resources, and other changes.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_Items\">New Items</span></h3>\n<table class=\"sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><b>Picture</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Name</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Price</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Shop</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Type</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/FestiveAxe.png/revision/latest?cb=20231211103257\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"FestiveAxe\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/FestiveAxe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/81?cb=20231211103257\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"81\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"FestiveAxe.png\" data-image-key=\"FestiveAxe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Festive_Axe\" title=\"Festive Axe\">Festive Axe</a>\n</td>\n<td>$16,900\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Tools\" title=\"Category:Tools\">Tool</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/58/Christmas_Wreath.png/revision/latest?cb=20231211162026\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Christmas Wreath\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/58/Christmas_Wreath.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20231211162026\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Christmas Wreath.png\" data-image-key=\"Christmas_Wreath.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Christmas_Wreath\" title=\"Christmas Wreath\">Christmas Wreath</a>\n</td>\n<td>$1,045\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>\n</td>\n<td>Object\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4f/Stocking.png/revision/latest?cb=20231211163214\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Stocking\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4f/Stocking.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20231211163214\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"81\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Stocking.png\" data-image-key=\"Stocking.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stocking\" title=\"Stocking\">Stocking</a>\n</td>\n<td>$450\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>\n</td>\n<td>Object\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<t